keywords:
  - synaptic vesicle release
  - excitation-inhibition balance
  - autism spectrum disorder
  - structural identifiability
  - homeostatic plasticity
  - quantal analysis
  - Fisher information
abstract: >-
  An exact moment-based model of multi-site stochastic vesicular release, with
  a structural identifiability analysis of the excitation-inhibition ratio, a
  compensation-invariant residual that distinguishes primary from compensatory
  presynaptic change, a resupply-limited ceiling on presynaptic homeostasis,
  and a validation against public human genomic and transcriptomic data.
